      "claim": "Pentazocine in cirrhosis has F 0.68-0.70 (L1 and L2), although its healthy control F was 0.18 (C68); this context is less transferable to a non-cirrhotic query but does not provide affirmative evidence against the query.",
      "card_ids": ["C17","C24","C34","C68"]
    },
